#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:12
#: 61d25527c7b84b8a816b674cdba59378
msgid ""
"ArduRoller is a BalanceBot frame originally designed by Jason Short "
"(described in `this Makezine article "
"<https://makezine.com/projects/arduroller-self-balancing-robot/>`__).  "
"Rover-3.5 (and higher) supports this frame as described below."
msgstr ""
"ArduRoller 是由 Jason Short 最初设计的平衡机器人车架（详见 `此 Makezine 文章 "
"<https://makezine.com/projects/arduroller-self-balancing-"
"robot/>`__）。Rover-3.5（及更高版本）支持该车架，如下所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:14
#: b735c41863c04ecf8c16a96784b6a9f3
msgid ""
"One issue with this frame is that there is some play in the motors which "
"leads to a slightly wobble when standing still.  This could be resolved by "
"using `stepper motors "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/9172>`__"
msgstr ""
"该车架的一个问题是电机存在一定间隙，导致静止时会有轻微抖动。可通过使用 `步进电机 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/9172>`__ 来解决此问题"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:17
#: 5d4b96df7406410e938016a3a08fe009
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:19
