msgid ""
"`ArduRoller 3D printed frame from Thingiverse.com "
"<https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:810998>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Thingiverse.com 上的 ArduRoller 3D 打印车架 "
"<https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:810998>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:20
#: 0eb33bd6641a4407846011317d684cc0
msgid ""
"`4\" clear platic globe <https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0044SEKA0>`__ "
"(optional)"
msgstr "`4 英寸透明塑料球 <https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0044SEKA0>`__ （可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:21
#: c6dea16bf9f449119bbdf09c368a39fe
msgid ""
"`mRobotics Pixhawk autopilot <https://store.mrobotics.io/Genuine-PixHawk-"
"Flight-Controller-p/mro-pixhawk1-minkit-mr.htm>`__.  :ref:`Other autopilots "
"<common-autopilots>` may also work but they must have GPIO input pins to "
"support the :ref:`wheel encoders <wheel-encoder>`."
msgstr ""
"`mRobotics Pixhawk 飞控 <https://store.mrobotics.io/Genuine-PixHawk-Flight-"
"Controller-p/mro-pixhawk1-minkit-mr.htm>`__。:ref:`其他飞控 <common-autopilots>` "
"也可能适用，但必须具有 GPIO 输入引脚以支持 :ref:`轮速编码器 <wheel-encoder>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:22
#: d51505d7ee0f4aacb090618114195ac7
msgid ""
"`RoboClaw 2x7A motor controller <https://www.pololu.com/product/3284>`__"
msgstr "`RoboClaw 2x7A 电机控制器 <https://www.pololu.com/product/3284>`__"

