#: e6905418316d4ca18e4c78e6f0ce5e8b
msgid ""
"`Wild Thumber Wheels with 4mm shaft adapters "
"<https://www.pololu.com/product/1557>`__"
msgstr "`Wild Thumper 车轮及 4mm 轴适配器 <https://www.pololu.com/product/1557>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:25
#: 4cb30bbe4d8d49fdb5701f567fb05c8b
