"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:29
#: c91907a883274921a08f1997d3b6a848
msgid "Connection and Setup"
msgstr "连接与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:31
#: ded9e2b5ed6445bd8f22052ea4df1092
msgid "Setup the Roboclaw motor driver:"
msgstr "设置 Roboclaw 电机驱动器："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:33
#: 122f29480819406a91fe7ea07931f0c5
msgid "Download and install the ION Studio configuration software"
msgstr "下载并安装 ION Studio 配置软件"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:34
#: fea3bff8bff540469ac600d29d51e0f8
msgid "Connect the Roboclaw motor driver to your PC with a USB cable"
msgstr "用 USB 线将 Roboclaw 电机驱动器连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:35
#: 1619da557d41448f9796075eedf0a2fe
msgid ""
"Connect with ION Studio then on the General Settings page, set Control Mode "
"= RC"
msgstr "用 ION Studio 连接，在「General Settings」页面将 Control Mode 设为 RC"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:36
#: b4e57936e30e4fb8bc470cfe90f52799
msgid "From the File menu, \"Save Setting\""
msgstr "通过「File」菜单，选择「Save Setting」"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:42
#: bc68736bc9e64e438aaf52d9c048e011
msgid ""
"Connect the yellow and white wires from the wheel encoders to the AUX OUT "
"3,4,5,6 pins as described on the :ref:`wheel encoder wiki page <wheel-"
"encoder>`"
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`轮速编码器 Wiki 页面 <wheel-encoder>` 的说明，将轮速编码器的黄色和白色导线连接到 AUX OUT "
"3、4、5、6 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:43
#: 91848f32998644c192dcb91d2242ee37
msgid "Connect the autopilot, motor driver and motors as shown below"
msgstr "按下图所示连接飞控、电机驱动器和电机"

