#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:53
#: 9fcfdccec9714003aabfb7ac62bd9dbe
msgid ""
"This parameter file can also be loaded using the Mission Planner's "
"Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree page by selecting \"ArduRoller-"
"balancebot\" from the drop down on the middle right and then push the \"Load"
" Presaved\" button."
msgstr ""
"此参数文件也可通过 Mission Planner 的「Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter "
"Tree」页面加载，从右中部的下拉菜单中选择「ArduRoller-balancebot」，然后点击「Load Presaved」按钮。"
